<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>No Brazilian soybean, products basis levels were available Monday because Chicago markets were closed for the U.S. Memorial Day holiday. The next figures will be published on Tuesday 27 May.</p>
</text>
